 "notes": "Smartwatch definition no longer includes GPS sports watches: Garmin D2 Mach 2 Pro and Approach S72 moved to Multisport GPS watch (m); fenix range became the fēnix archetype. Old models attached as versions: Apple Watch SE 3/Series 11/Ultra 3, Galaxy Watch8/Ultra, Enduro 4, fenix 8 Pro and fenix 9, Charge 6, Inspire 3, Smart Band 9, ScanWatch 2/Light/Nova, Vivomove Sport, Whoop 5.0, Polar Loop, Helio Strap. Apple Watch Series 1-3, Gear S years, Galaxy Watch years, Mi Band 3+ years, Enduro 1-2 years left blank (not on fetched pages). Galaxy Watch Ultra kept as a version, not a separate archetype. Garmin vivosmart and Bounce kept in m (no page fetched for a line). Approach range and Garmin D2 not made archetypes (no fetched page). Withings Activité year unknown."
